message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Predictive Maintenance + GenAI Insight Generator"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end predictive maintenance platform. A TensorFlow LSTM predicts
  equipment failure 24 hours ahead from sensor telemetry, and a language model
  turns each prediction into a plain-English maintenance report grounded in the
  engineered features the model actually consumed. Served over a FastAPI REST
  API with a Streamlit dashboard.
